    <briefdescription>
<para>Radix-rank using matching which computes the counts of keys for each digit value early, at the expense of doing more work. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This may be useful e.g. for decoupled look-back, where it reduces the time other thread blocks need to wait for digit counts to become available. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
